{"title":"Pirate Bosun","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 15 Pirate that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/pirates-windlass\">Pirates Windlass</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 1 looted corpse recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 1 recorded drop, 69 total, 69 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×69</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bolt\" title=\"Bolt - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 5 total, 5 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b4362887a1f8d7b3462f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bolt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×5</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"jackalhide-torso\" title=\"Jackalhide Torso - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/4fb018ef7eb4a35bbb32.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Jackalhide Torso</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bearhide-arms\" title=\"Bearhide Arms - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/9da825311bcf4ccc4c8a.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bearhide Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/bosun-grell\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/7b35448a2f581feca186.svg\" alt=\"\"><b>Bosun Grell</b><span>Lv 15</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Pirate: <a href=\"#/monster/pirate\">Pirate</a> <span class=\"muted\">(9)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/pirate-sea-witch\">Sea Witch</a> <span class=\"muted\">(17)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/pirate-marksman\">Pirate Marksman</a> <span class=\"muted\">(18)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/pirate-captain\">Pirate Captain</a> <span class=\"muted\">(20)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/5722c12539847db50cfa.svg\" alt=\"Pirate Bosun\"></div><h3>Pirate Bosun</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>15</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 15)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Pirate</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>46</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>12.8</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>750</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.3 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>1 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}